      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "8sv619b",
      "content": "        (B)  3 A"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "yt7404t",
      "content": "        (C)  1 A"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "2j3jbw4",
      "content": "        (D)  6 A"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "e1ktblu",
      "content": "<strong>Answer: </strong>(A)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "jw6r9rq",
      "content": "<strong>Q3.  </strong>A wire of resistance R is stretched to double its original length. What is the new resistance?"
